]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0034\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please star the thistle receipt paperwork for me?\", \"Sorry, wrong document — I meant the cellar booking one.\", \"Would you mind showing me my entries from this month in my journal?\", \"How many are there altogether, please?\", \"Could you find the photos with Wathie Thevsen in them?\"], [\"star the thistle receipt paperwork\", \"oops wrong doc, i meant the cellar booking one\", \"also what did i write this month in my journal\", \"how many total\", \"pics with Wathie Thevsen in them?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0035\", \"v\": [[\"text Sunita the gate code pls\", \"diff thing, got any stargazing pictures?\", \"whats on my calendar that day\"], [\"text Sunita the gate code\", \"any stargazing pictures?\", \"calendar that day?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0036\", \"v\": [[\"barometer — who is coming?\"], [\"I'm trying to work out numbers for the barometer thing so nobody gets left out — can you tell me who is coming to it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0037\", \"v\": [[\"when is the barometer thing\", \"hang on, what did i write last week in my journal\", \"ok back to that, who else is gonna be there\"], [\"I keep losing track of dates this month and I need to plan around the barometer, so when is it again?\", \"Oh hang on, before I forget — I wanted to look back at how I've been feeling, can you pull up what I wrote last week in my journal?\", \"Right, going back to the repair thing from before — who else is going to be there?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0038\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please export my entire locker to a plain file?\", \"In that case, would you mind deleting all of my delivery appointments?\"], [\"export whole locker to plain file\", \"delete all delivery appointments\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0039\", \"v\": [[\"We've had a long week and I think we deserve a treat, so could you buy us some cinema tickets for the weekend?\"], [\"Would you be able to buy cinema tickets for the weekend, please?\"]]}","ttft_ms":13615,"type":"result","duration